  (polyline
    (pts (xy 1805 595) (xy 2100 595) (xy 2100 609.9) (xy 1805 609.9) (xy 1805 595))
    (stroke (width 0.25) (type default))
    (fill (type none))
    (uuid "c20da73b-03e1-49a2-a3f7-e0057ed95f89"))
  (text
    "1. Function: MP5077 enables the local3.3V clock/support branch after core PG. VIN_3V3 from U16 (5 V cable input) feeds FPGA buck inputs and GTP LDO BIAS directly. The carrier port switch limits cable current."
    (at 1807 597 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "eb4842fa-b68b-4951-8964-4aff9d1484d2"))
  (text
    "2. Source / changes: Trenz TE0714-04-42I-7-L REV04(20Dec2022),p9 Q1/R52/C1/input-output bypass copied: https://www.trenz-electronic.de/trenzdownloads/Trenz_Electronic/Modules_and_Module_Carriers/3x4/TE0714/REV04/Documents/SCH-TE0714-04-42I-7-L.PDF MPS\nMP5077 Rev1.2(15Aug2023),p2 pinout,pp11-14 limit/SS/land pattern: https://www.monolithicpower.com/en/documentview/productdocument/index/version/2/document_type/Datasheet/lang/EN/sku/MP5077 V63 replaces whole-board TPS259470A; R34/R35/R36 removed.\nR37=24k1%,C77=22nF50VX7R; C75/C76=22uF; added C102/C104=22uF andC103=470nF. Nominal branch ILIM3.42A and source SS label3.5ms are not whole-board cable ratings. TP1/TP13 GND,TP2 rawVIN andTP3 branch retained. Exact Trenz passive MPNs not disclosed;\nsource-matched candidates/pending selections identified in fields. Startup,cable loss,source/branch interactions and thermal behavior remain unqualified."
    (at 1807 599.98 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "6c09e187-bb3e-49fa-a0ab-4da4e51257d0"))
  (polyline
    (pts (xy 1870 1225) (xy 2110 1225) (xy 2110 1245.8400000000001) (xy 1870 1245.8400000000001) (xy 1870 1225))
    (stroke (width 0.25) (type default))
    (fill (type none))
    (uuid "ef5b3f0c-615d-4dcd-9c28-8a7edcf1936a"))
  (text
    "1. Function: U15 passes M15 EN_GTPWR_1V5 to U13 EN at3.3V. R58=4.99k pulls A HIGH by default; DIR HIGH selects A-to-B. R57=10k pulls B LOW when translator power is absent. C105/C106=100nF bypass both supply\nrails."
    (at 1872 1227 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "61f4fd14-64b7-419d-82be-fdba44ef2959"))
  (text
    "2. Source / changes: Codex voltage adaptation of Trenz TE0714 REV04 pp5,6,9: M15 EN_GTPWR,4.99k default pullup and two cascaded open-drain inverters.\nhttps://www.trenz-electronic.de/trenzdownloads/Trenz_Electronic/Modules_and_Module_Carriers/3x4/TE0714/REV04/Documents/SCH-TE0714-04-42I-7-L.PDF Trenz3.3V input threshold cannot accept our preserved1.5V\nbank. U15 replaces its two-inverter function; R57 pulldown intentionally delays GTP enable until1.5V and switched3.3V are valid. TI SN74AXC1T45 SCES882E RevE Dec2023 pp3,5-6,17-18,22.\nhttps://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/sn74axc1t45.pdf At125C Ioff<=7.5uA:10k+1% gives<=75.75mV; powered VOL<=0.1V at100uA. U13 EN LOW<=0.3V/HIGH>=1.2V (MPS MPM3834C Rev1.01 p4).\nhttps://www.monolithicpower.com/en/documentview/productdocument/index/version/2/document_type/Datasheet/lang/en/sku/MPM3834CGPA/ MPS EN current has typical values only; combined maximum leakage and board\nstartup ramps remain unqualified.100nF per rail is our choice under TI close-bypass guidance."
    (at 1872 1231.96 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "e7eeebb0-1fd5-4a0c-814f-8d0fad05c212"))
  (polyline
    (pts (xy 20 225) (xy 620 225) (xy 620 233.95999999999998) (xy 20 233.95999999999998) (xy 20 225))
    (stroke (width 0.25) (type default))
    (fill (type none))
    (uuid "7d2547a7-de24-40ba-98f3-652552c5f69c"))
  (text
    "1. Function: U1 / J1 / J2: Route116 active signals for eight1.5V ASICs through two60-contact mezzanines. J1.60 carries U16-regulated VIN_3V3; J2.60 remains reserved analog."
    (at 22 227 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "6314a9c9-b857-4969-bb66-22b34970014f"))
  (text
    "2. Source / changes: Codex custom ASIC interface; inherited V54/V62 pin contract preserved. ASIC_REFERENCE.md sections2-5; Chip_FPGA Interface.pptx slides13-17/25-28; Pins.xlsx. Trenz p5 I/O bank use adapted to ASIC allocation. https://www.trenz-electronic.de/trenzdownloads/Trenz_Electronic/Modules_and_Module_Carriers/3x4/TE0714/REV04/Documents/SCH-TE0714-04-42I-7-L.PDF ASIC silicon timing/rail limits remain unqualified."
    (at 22 229.98 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "674b6bc0-0673-4c6d-89c2-94beeae3d550"))
  (polyline
    (pts (xy 735 230) (xy 1295 230) (xy 1295 246) (xy 735 246) (xy 735 230))
    (stroke (width 0.25) (type default))
    (fill (type none))
    (uuid "e9129793-402b-4b86-b1f0-5d78531b6f49"))
  (text
    "1. Function: J3 carries three GT recording TX pairs, regular-I/O commands, JTAG and 5 V power (contact 19 -> VIN_5V -> U16). TX0 connects to XEM; TX1/TX2 end open at carrier."
    (at 737 232 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "625cd497-db83-4890-9dbe-c436108508a5"))
  (text
    "2. Source / changes: Codex custom HDMI map adapted from V3: 9/11 add TX2 via C204/C205; 12/14 move from GTP RX1 to U1 V3/V2 regular I/O.\nAMD DS181 v1.27.1 Table 50: CEXT=100 nF; C200-C205 are candidates. https://docs.amd.com/api/khub/documents/iAkxxTOk96ANLJqYf2hgrQ/content\nUnused RX1 A4/A3 grounded: AMD UG482 v1.9 Table 5-6 pp.223-224. https://docs.amd.com/api/khub/documents/Xk_zMbXsJj92suJ4_0Akkg/content\n1.5 V Bank34 command proposal: DIFF_SSTL15, IN_TERM=UNTUNED_SPLIT_50; AMD UG471 v1.10 Table 1-7. https://docs.amd.com/api/khub/documents/IbGcnPFe6eF19RHma_Y~IA/content\nCarrier needs compatible regular I/O and VIO1=1.5 V. TX0 connects to XEM; TX1/TX2 are future carrier NC. Pin/clock/protocol, coupling, cable SI, shell bonding and unpowered-target protection remain unverified. V5 changes contact 19 from 3.3 V to 5 V (carrier TPS2553 port feed)."
    (at 737 234.98 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "bc15503f-5160-4f65-a341-1a039d82f68e"))
  (polyline
    (pts (xy 1435 1050) (xy 1730 1050) (xy 1730 1062.92) (xy 1435 1062.92) (xy 1435 1050))
    (stroke (width 0.25) (type default))
    (fill (type none))
    (uuid "a217ced4-26db-47d3-b8cf-41802382508a"))
  (text
    "1. Function: U4: Generate1.5V for ASIC banks14/15/34, U8 A-side, Y2 and U15 A-side; enabled by core PG. PG participates in reset readiness."
    (at 1437 1052 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "7c0da807-cd8b-450b-a7bd-9f6c961e19c4"))
  (text
    "2. Source / changes: Codex adaptation of Trenz p9 buck structure: separate1.5V converter retained for required ASIC interface. R7/R8 divider remains150k/100k,0.1%; U3PG->PG_CORE enable avoids GTP/1.5V dependency.\nhttps://www.trenz-electronic.de/trenzdownloads/Trenz_Electronic/Modules_and_Module_Carriers/3x4/TE0714/REV04/Documents/SCH-TE0714-04-42I-7-L.PDF\nhttps://www.monolithicpower.com/en/documentview/productdocument/index/version/2/document_type/Datasheet/lang/en/sku/MPM3834CGPA/ .55A board input remains a workload allowance, not measured maximum."
    (at 1437 1054.98 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "6cdd95e9-9874-425e-a80f-3b6533b2f38e"))
  (polyline
    (pts (xy 755 930) (xy 1155 930) (xy 1155 940.94) (xy 755 940.94) (xy 755 930))
    (stroke (width 0.25) (type default))
    (fill (type none))
    (uuid "ed115568-72a8-43e9-bce2-b461fb7ee7f7"))
  (text
    "1. Function: ASIC-bank bypass: Bank14 C24-C29+C101=3x4.7u+4x470n; Bank15 C30-C35=2x4.7u+4x470n; Bank34 C36-C40=2x4.7u+3x470n. C42=47u shared1.5V bulk."
    (at 757 932 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "925e9eb9-8388-444a-8703-2f8cc7b0b166"))
  (text
