    "2. Source / changes: Trenz TE0714 REV04 p9 U5 AVCC LDO sequence and1.3k/4.99k divider restored: our R10 1.24k->1.3k; R9 finalPG\npullup4.99k. C46 restored10nF10VX7R. TPS748 RevN, Fig7-1/SS section. https://www.trenz-electronic.de/trenzdownloads/Trenz_Electronic\n/Modules_and_Module_Carriers/3x4/TE0714/REV04/Documents/SCH-TE0714-04-42I-7-L.PDF https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/tps74801.pdf"
    (at 1457 1284.98 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "f741937b-c717-4d2f-aed1-6c4e7ed1192d"))
  (polyline
    (pts (xy 1665 1280) (xy 1820 1280) (xy 1820 1294.9) (xy 1665 1294.9) (xy 1665 1280))
    (stroke (width 0.25) (type default))
    (fill (type none))
    (uuid "7c8ab84d-c4e8-40ea-8c9d-8abf9ae14ae9"))
  (text
    "1. Function: U6: Regulate1.4V input to1.2V MGTAVTT. U13 PG enables U6; U6 PG then enables U5 AVCC."
    (at 1667 1282 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "62701033-b735-42b6-99c7-2898db8dc9d9"))
  (text
    "2. Source / changes: Trenz TE0714 REV04 p9 U6 AVTT-first LDO sequence restored. Our R13/R14=2.49k/4.99k retained; R12=4.99k now\npulls our U6 PG up. C50 restored10nF10VX7R. https://www.trenz-electronic.de/trenzdownloads/Trenz_Electronic/Modules_and_Module_Carri\ners/3x4/TE0714/REV04/Documents/SCH-TE0714-04-42I-7-L.PDF https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/tps74801.pdf Startup/power-down\nqualification pending."
    (at 1667 1284.98 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "af6f9054-eda7-4d15-b48b-78d12475ee1e"))
  (polyline
    (pts (xy 1105 560) (xy 1385 560) (xy 1385 572.9200000000001) (xy 1105 572.9200000000001) (xy 1105 560))
