  (text
    "1. Function: U1 core/BRAM bypass: C4-C11,C89-C93 now3x100uF+3x4.7uF+7x470nF on1.0V (317.39uF nominal)."
    (at 1107 562 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "3f3216ca-af2a-4ea7-89b3-a60e12928dc9"))
  (text
    "2. Source / changes: Restored Trenz TE0714 REV04 p7 core/BRAM group: 100uF C8/C54/C56;4.7uF C43/C48/C55;470nF C52/C49/C50/C51/C13/C11/C27. Our C10 47u->100u, added C89-C93. Adapted C4/C10/C89 from 1206 (10%) to 0805 Murata GRM21BR60J107ME15L (100uF 6.3V X5R 20%, https://www.mouser.com/datasheet/2/281/1/GRM21BR60J107ME15_01A-1986857.pdf) for V6 size reduction. https://www.trenz-electronic.de/trenzdownloads/Trenz_Electronic/Modules_and_Module_Carriers/3x4/TE0714/REV04/Documents/SCH-TE0714-04-42I-7-L.PDF DC bias, layout, PDN and\nadded startup charge remain unverified."
    (at 1107 564.98 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top))
