  (text "1. Function: U16 converts the 5 V cable feed on J3 contact 19 (VIN_5V, about 4.4-5.0 V after cable drop) into VIN_3V3, which supplies every existing regulator,\nlogic part and J1.60 unchanged. C206/C207 input, C208 local output; EN tied to VIN_5V; PG unused; TP14 probes the cable voltage at the frontend." (at 1127.08 135.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f91b2071-9304-4df3-8285-fb1ae3dbae86"))
  (text "2. Source / changes: MPS MPM3834C Rev 1.01 (6/14/2022) Fig. 4 p17 typical application; Table 1 p14 (3.3 V: R1=200k, R2=44.2k); input/output capacitor guidance p14;\nVIN 2.75-6 V operating, 6.5 V abs max p3. https://www.monolithicpower.com/en/documentview/productdocument/index/version/2/document_type/Datasheet/lang/en/sku/MPM3834CGPA/\nAdapted by Claude Code: R59/R60 = Table 1 values (VOUT = 0.6 V x (1 + 200k/44.2k) = 3.31 V); CFF not stuffed as Fig. 4; Fig. 4 R3/R4 EN divider replaced by direct EN tie (as U2);\ninput 2 x 22 uF 10 V (Fig. 4: one 22 uF); TP14 added. Unverified: cable hot-plug overshoot vs 6.5 V abs max (cable resistance should damp it; measure), real frontend current, layout and thermal." (at 1127.08 142.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2b8aeba4-c036-4981-acba-1286fba810f6"))
)
